{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03985","headline":"晦日重宴 · 韩仲宣","name":"晦日重宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤苑先吹晚，龙楼夕照披。\n陈遵已投辖，山公正坐池。\n落日催金奏，飞霞送玉巵。\n此时陪绮席，不醉欲何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩仲宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03985.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03985","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}